  "about_item": [
    "Our one-of-a-kind Tick Removal Tool is hand-crafted and perfectly aligned to safely remove ticks. This tick removal tool for dogs and cats can remove ticks from various sized pets.",
    "Veterinarian and Groomer tested and approved. Hand-crafted, perfectly aligned tweezer tips extract ticks with precision. Ergonomic tweezer body design is wider and longer for added stability.​​ Textured design provides no-slip grip during use.​",
    "To use this tick remover, gently move your pet's fur away to expose the tick. Position the tweezer to grasp the tick firmly by getting as close to your pet's skin as possible. With even pressure, grip the tick and pull upwards to completely extract it.",
    "To use this cat and dog tick remover do not twist or squeeze the tick. Avoid pulling on the coat.",
    "TOOL CARE: Clean tweezer tips after each use with alcohol wipe. Tweezer can be cleaned in an autoclave."
  ],
